  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting a strong and well managed economy and public sector for Tuvalu (2021-2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will consolidate 3 areas of support to Tuvalu:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Policy Reform Matrix budget support;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Contributions to the Tuvalu Trust Fund;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Support the Tuvalu Trust Fund, its committees, and Board through the provision of advisory services; and&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Support scoping and design work to identify opportunities for New&#xa0;Zealand to more effectively support Tuvalu&apos;s economy and public sector.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
